{"result":{"acceptance_year":null,"advert_code":"AC-7504","advert_description":"Nab\u00edz\u00edme k dlouhodob\u00e9mu pron\u00e1jmu pln\u011b za\u0159\u00edzen\u00fd byt 2+kk, 52,5 m\u00b2, s balkonem 3,7 m\u00b2 v reziden\u010dn\u00edm projektu AALTO Cibulka. Byt se nach\u00e1z\u00ed ve 5.NP novostavby, ulice Naskov\u00e9, Praha 5 \u2013 Ko\u0161\u00ed\u0159e. V cen\u011b pron\u00e1jmu je jedno gar\u00e1\u017eov\u00e9 st\u00e1n\u00ed a sklep. \n\nInteri\u00e9r bytu tvo\u0159\u00ed ob\u00fdvac\u00ed pokoj s pln\u011b vybavenou kuchy\u0148skou linkou se spot\u0159ebi\u010di, j\u00eddeln\u00edm stolem a rozkl\u00e1dac\u00ed seda\u010dkou, samostatn\u00e1 lo\u017enice s prostornou vestav\u011bnou sk\u0159\u00edn\u00ed a postel\u00ed, koupelna se sprchovac\u00edm koutem, WC a kombinovanou pra\u010dkou se su\u0161i\u010dkou. Sou\u010d\u00e1st\u00ed vybaven\u00ed bytu jsou z\u00e1clony, z\u00e1v\u011bsy a p\u0159edokenn\u00ed \u017ealuzie.\n\nVelkou v\u00fdhodou je spr\u00e1va bytu. N\u00e1jemci je k dispozici kontaktn\u00ed osoba, kter\u00e1 operativn\u011b \u0159e\u0161\u00ed ve\u0161ker\u00e9 z\u00e1le\u017eitosti spojen\u00e9 s n\u00e1jmem. N\u00e1jemci je tak zaji\u0161t\u011bno bezprobl\u00e9mov\u00e9 u\u017e\u00edv\u00e1n\u00ed bytu bez starost\u00ed a s kompletn\u00edm servisem.\n\nReziden\u010dn\u00ed projekt stoj\u00ed na sam\u00e9m okraji p\u0159\u00edrodn\u00edho parku Ko\u0161\u00ed\u0159e-Motol, v sousedstv\u00ed park\u016f Vidoule a Cibulka.\n\nDobr\u00e1 dostupnost do centra, na metro B And\u011bl trv\u00e1 j\u00edzda busem 13 min., OC Nov\u00fd Sm\u00edchov autem 9 min. Na nedalek\u00e9 Plze\u0148sk\u00e9 ulici je kompletn\u00ed ob\u010dansk\u00e1 vybavenost.\n\nByt bude k dispozici od 1.11.2026.","advert_images":[{"ai_edited":false,"alt":"","height":1365,"id":1008771545,"kind":2,"order":1,"url":"//d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qF_A/kBoPC1H7Bt4QtWpHqIztq/ee53.jpeg","width":2048},{"ai_edited":false,"alt":"","height":1365,"id":1008771560,"kind":2,"order":2,"url"